<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<chapter xml:id="ch-analytic-geometry" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Analytic Geometry</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      This chapter examines the <m>xy</m>-plane, discussing axes, quadrants, points, and distance.
      We examine specific equations in the plane, including lines, circles, and parabolas.
      Along the way, we develop additional techniques for solving quadratic equations.</p>
  </introduction>;

